# Fog settings

option.borderFog=边界雾气
option.borderFog.comment=渲染视距边缘被浓雾笼罩以隐藏区块边界.
option.caveFog=洞穴雾气
option.caveFog.comment=在地下洞穴区域应用稍微发光的雾气. 可以使巨型洞穴氛围更棒, 也有助于看清洞穴形状.
option.bloomyFog=泛光雾
option.bloomyFog.comment=雾气的强烈泛光. 使得明亮事物发出的光像是在雾气中散射, 并且照亮后方区域. 几乎没有性能消耗.
option.bloomyFogIntensity=泛光雾强度
option.bloomyFogIntensity.comment=调节泛光雾的强度.
option.overworldFogIntensity=主世界雾气强度
option.overworldFogIntensity.comment=Controls overworld fog intensity.
value.mistMode.mistModeOff=Off
value.mistMode.mistModeBasic=Basic
value.mistMode.mistModeAdvanced=Advanced
option.mistMode=Ground Mist
option.mistMode.comment=Ground-hugging haze layer. Off = disabled. Basic = two-octave noise mist with density-varying phase and wetness coupling. Advanced = adds per-step sun self-shadowing with cloud occlusion and grazing-angle cost gating.
option.mistModeOff=Off
option.mistModeBasic=Basic
option.mistModeAdvanced=Advanced
option.mistDensity=Mist Density
option.mistDensity.comment=Overall thickness of the mist layer. Higher values produce denser, more opaque ground fog.
option.mistAltitude=Mist Ceiling
option.mistAltitude.comment=Maximum altitude (blocks) above which mist cannot exist. Lower values keep mist close to the ground.
option.mistFalloffRate=Mist Falloff Rate
option.mistFalloffRate.comment=How quickly mist thins with altitude above sea level. Higher = thinner layer, lower = mist reaches higher.
option.mistSeaLevelBias=Mist Sea Level Bias
option.mistSeaLevelBias.comment=Shifts the mist base up or down relative to the configured sea level. Positive = mist starts higher, negative = mist starts lower.
option.mistShadowSteps=Mist Shadow Steps
option.mistShadowSteps.comment=Number of ray-march steps toward the sun for mist self-shadowing (Advanced mode only). Higher = more accurate self-shadowing at higher GPU cost.
option.ozoneLayer=臭氧吸收层
option.ozoneLayer.comment=向大气模型中添加可调节的平流层臭氧层（查普伊斯吸收带，400-650nm）。影响阳光、月光、云层照明、天空、雾、薄雾与地面反弹光。在黎明和黄昏最为明显。
option.ozoneAmount=臭氧含量
option.ozoneAmount.comment=臭氧层的强度。1.00 为自然含量；更高的值会加深暮光时天顶的蓝色并使地平线光更偏红；0 则禁用吸收。
option.ozoneAltitude=臭氧层高度
option.ozoneAltitude.comment=臭氧层的峰值高度（公里）。真实臭氧层约在 20-30 公里处达到峰值；层越高，地平线掠射路径的饱和越弱。
option.ozoneThickness=臭氧层厚度
option.ozoneThickness.comment=层的厚度（公里）。薄层集中吸收并放大地平线掠射路径；厚层则分散吸收。
option.ozoneSky=臭氧天空吸收
option.ozoneSky.comment=将臭氧层应用于天空：对大气施加视线与光路吸收，加深暮光时的蓝色天顶并暖化地平线光。
option.ozoneFog=臭氧雾散射
option.ozoneFog.comment=将臭氧层应用于空气雾：臭氧感知的多重散射近似，散射阶数越高，绿红分量被臭氧吸收带吸收得越多。
option.ozoneMist=臭氧薄雾色调
option.ozoneMist.comment=将臭氧层应用于地面薄雾：黎明与黄昏时，薄雾色调会带上经臭氧过滤的暮光光谱。
option.ozonePlanetBounce=臭氧地面反弹
option.ozonePlanetBounce.comment=将臭氧层应用于地面反弹光：从地面反弹的光在向上回到天空途中再次经过臭氧层过滤。
option.renderBelowPlanet=Render Below Planet
option.renderBelowPlanet.comment=Renders the planet ground disc for below-horizon rays instead of stretching the horizon sky downward.
option.renderBelowPlanetIntensity=Below Planet Brightness
option.renderBelowPlanetIntensity.comment=Brightness of the planet ground rendered below the horizon.
option.vl=体积雾
option.vl.comment=添加光轴和可变雾气密度.
option.airFogCloudyNoise=云雾
option.airFogCloudyNoise.comment=为雾气边缘添加微妙的云层形状, 在清晨更容易看清楚. 需要启用体积雾!
option.airFogColoredLightShafts=光轴着色
option.airFogColoredLightShafts.comment=光轴穿过半透明事物时会被其颜色所沾染.

